Lemma 42: op(K(X, Y), rdiv(Z, K(X, Y))) = Z.
Proof:
  op(K(X, Y), rdiv(Z, K(X, Y)))
= { by lemma 41 R->L }
  op(Z, K(K(X, Y), rdiv(Z, K(X, Y)))) (peak)
= { by axiom 7 (sos) }
  op(Z, 1)
= { by lemma 25 }
  op(Z, zero)
= { by axiom 1 (sos) }
