Lemma 43: T(rdiv(X, Y), Y) = ldiv(Y, X).
Proof:
  T(rdiv(X, Y), Y)
= { by axiom 5 (sos) }
  ldiv(Y, op(rdiv(X, Y), Y)) (peak)
= { by axiom 9 (sos) }
